WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.203
"Let's get out of here!"

2
00:00:14.566 --> 00:00:15.566
shouted to his friends.

3
00:00:16.347 --> 00:00:18.708
He ran, with Darb and Perda on his heels.

4
00:00:19.468 --> 00:00:24.071
Out of the corner of his eye, he noticed the nomads disappearing into some scrubby brush in the

5
00:00:24.111 --> 00:00:24.751
other direction.

6
00:00:25.531 --> 00:00:27.232
"Stop!" Morb snarled.

7
00:00:27.853 --> 00:00:29.173
"I wish to speak with you."

8
00:00:30.134 --> 00:00:31.815
There was a flash of magic energy.

9
00:00:34.264 --> 00:00:37.626
"Oof!" Zann grunted as he crashed into a glowing green wall.

10
00:00:38.426 --> 00:00:39.747
He and his friends spun around.

11
00:00:40.768 --> 00:00:42.669
Morb stalked toward them with a sneer.

12
00:00:42.689 --> 00:00:45.210
"Aren't you happy to see me?"

13
00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:46.131
he asked.

14
00:00:46.151 --> 00:00:48.152
"How about your friend?"

15
00:00:48.932 --> 00:00:53.054
Morb stepped aside, revealing someone who had been hidden behind him.

16
00:00:53.074 --> 00:00:55.356
"Gliss!" Darb cried.

17
00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:57.137
Gliss looked terrible.

18
00:00:57.797 --> 00:01:03.220
Her face was streaked with tears, and her hair was messy and tangled with twigs and leaves.

19
00:01:04.368 --> 00:01:05.769
"What did you do to her?"

20
00:01:06.149 --> 00:01:07.910
Perda cried, rushing toward Gliss.

21
00:01:08.611 --> 00:01:09.851
Morb snapped his fingers.

22
00:01:10.512 --> 00:01:14.014
The sand between Perda and Gliss turned into molten lava.

23
00:01:14.614 --> 00:01:17.075
Perda barely stopped in time to keep from getting burned.

24
00:01:17.776 --> 00:01:18.776
Zann's heart raced.

25
00:01:19.417 --> 00:01:23.019
How did Morb have this much power, especially in the Far Frontier?

26
00:01:23.039 --> 00:01:26.661
"Your little friend is just fine—for now."

27
00:01:26.981 --> 00:01:27.641
Morb smirked.

28
00:01:27.661 --> 00:01:32.764
"I was sick of hearing her cry, so I used an Immobilization spell on her."

29
00:01:33.692 --> 00:01:35.493
Zann wished that Wyssa would return.

30
00:01:36.253 --> 00:01:39.334
She was the only one who might be strong enough to fight Morb.

31
00:01:39.354 --> 00:01:41.115
"But don't worry."

32
00:01:41.655 --> 00:01:42.696
Morb was still talking.

33
00:01:42.716 --> 00:01:45.477
"I've kept your friend healthy and strong.

34
00:01:46.017 --> 00:01:50.839
I want her magic energy at full force when I feed her to my new contraption.

35
00:01:51.479 --> 00:01:53.460
And then you kids are next!"

36
00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:55.701
He glanced toward Darb.

37
00:01:55.721 --> 00:01:58.062
"Well, maybe I'll spare the Void.

38
00:01:58.522 --> 00:02:01.523
After all, he's got no magic to contribute."

39
00:02:02.484 --> 00:02:03.184
Zann gulped.

40
00:02:03.852 --> 00:02:05.093
This was bad!

41
00:02:05.893 --> 00:02:09.895
He'd seen what happened when Morb "fed" people and creatures to his contraptions.

42
00:02:11.176 --> 00:02:13.077
They all ended up drained of magic.

43
00:02:13.777 --> 00:02:14.738
And often dead!

44
00:02:15.538 --> 00:02:17.840
Zann's only hope was for Wyssa to show up.

45
00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:22.002
Maybe if he kept Morb talking, he could buy some time.

46
00:02:22.022 --> 00:02:25.564
"So what is this new contraption supposed to do, anyway?"

47
00:02:25.984 --> 00:02:26.584
Zann asked.

48
00:02:26.604 --> 00:02:32.327
"I mean, if our magic is going to power it, we deserve to know, right?"

49
00:02:32.367 --> 00:02:33.168
Morb chuckled.

50
00:02:33.752 --> 00:02:35.293
"That's my little secret.

51
00:02:35.953 --> 00:02:38.694
All of Magica will find out its purpose soon enough."

52
00:02:39.454 --> 00:02:41.894
Perda seemed to catch on to what Zann was doing.

53
00:02:41.914 --> 00:02:45.875
"But why build it way out here in the Far Frontier?"

54
00:02:46.156 --> 00:02:46.656
she asked.

55
00:02:46.676 --> 00:02:49.817
"To avoid prying eyes, of course."

56
00:02:50.277 --> 00:02:51.337
Morb smirked again.

57
00:02:51.357 --> 00:02:52.977
"But don't worry.

58
00:02:53.318 --> 00:02:56.678
My associate in First City is already preparing for its arrival."

59
00:02:57.499 --> 00:02:58.279
An associate?

60
00:02:59.079 --> 00:03:01.700
Zann exchanged a surprised look with his friends.

61
00:03:02.508 --> 00:03:03.889
Who was Morb talking about?

62
00:03:03.909 --> 00:03:09.593
"It seems right that you kids will be the ones to provide the power to transport my contraption

63
00:03:09.653 --> 00:03:11.554
to First City," Morb continued.

64
00:03:11.574 --> 00:03:16.377
"After all, you were the ones who delayed my plans so greatly."

65
00:03:16.397 --> 00:03:18.819
"We delayed your plans?"

66
00:03:19.239 --> 00:03:20.040
Perda exclaimed.

67
00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:21.921
"What are you talking about?"

68
00:03:22.762 --> 00:03:24.883
Morb pointed a bony finger at her.

69
00:03:24.903 --> 00:03:27.705
"By taking so long to rescue me from Skellia!

70
00:03:28.265 --> 00:03:29.946
I thought you were cleverer than that.

71
00:03:30.507 --> 00:03:32.028
Clearly I overestimated you."

72
00:03:32.832 --> 00:03:35.314
That gave Zann another idea to keep him talking.

73
00:03:35.334 --> 00:03:38.197
"How did you survive in that world anyway?"

74
00:03:38.477 --> 00:03:38.937
he asked.

75
00:03:38.957 --> 00:03:41.960
"And how were you able to send me those messages?

76
00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:45.723
Your brother said he left you with only a weak pair of infused gloves."

77
00:03:46.664 --> 00:03:49.106
"Unless he was lying," Perda muttered.

78
00:03:49.126 --> 00:03:51.989
"Maybe Maff is Morb's associate."

79
00:03:52.689 --> 00:03:56.673
Zann's eyes widened, and he wondered uneasily if Perda was right.

80
00:03:57.433 --> 00:04:00.116
Could Maff have been working with his brother all along?

81
00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:02.921
"Ah, my brother."

82
00:04:03.362 --> 00:04:05.843
Morb spat out the word as if it tasted bad.

83
00:04:06.644 --> 00:04:10.927
"Yes, he tried to hold me back, just as my entire family has done all my life.

84
00:04:11.647 --> 00:04:12.748
But I was too smart for him.

85
00:04:13.308 --> 00:04:17.871
My travels have taught me more about magic than you silly Reds will ever know."

86
00:04:17.891 --> 00:04:19.692
"What do you mean?"

87
00:04:20.033 --> 00:04:20.633
Darb asked.

88
00:04:20.653 --> 00:04:23.075
"Didn't your friend Wyssa tell you?"

89
00:04:23.595 --> 00:04:24.336
Morb cackled.

90
00:04:25.136 --> 00:04:29.399
"She was the one who taught me the spells and secrets of her home world—the ones that even

91
00:04:29.479 --> 00:04:30.780
a Void can master."

92
00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:33.841
"What?" Perda blurted out.

93
00:04:33.861 --> 00:04:36.761
"Wyssa taught you how to do magic?"

94
00:04:36.781 --> 00:04:38.122
"At first."

95
00:04:38.622 --> 00:04:39.262
Morb shrugged.

96
00:04:39.282 --> 00:04:44.664
"Of course, I soon surpassed her basic lessons and continued learning on my own."

97
00:04:45.844 --> 00:04:46.364
He chuckled.

98
00:04:47.084 --> 00:04:50.925
"Although I made a few mistakes while I was learning to control my new power.

99
00:04:51.365 --> 00:04:54.306
That's why Wyssa can never return to her home world."

100
00:04:55.026 --> 00:04:58.007
Zann's head was spinning with everything that Morb had just said.

101
00:04:58.787 --> 00:05:04.125
He already knew that Wyssa used to work for Morb, procuring off-world objects and creatures for him.

102
00:05:04.786 --> 00:05:09.749
But he didn't know she was the one who'd given Morb his first taste of magical power!

103
00:05:09.769 --> 00:05:16.932
"Speaking of Wyssa," Morb said, interrupting Zann's thoughts, "I hope you're not keeping me talking in the hope

104
00:05:16.953 --> 00:05:19.114
that she'll come back to rescue you."

105
00:05:19.134 --> 00:05:21.535
"W-what do you mean?"

106
00:05:22.015 --> 00:05:22.636
Perda asked.

107
00:05:22.656 --> 00:05:25.177
"She's of no use to me anymore."

108
00:05:25.597 --> 00:05:26.538
Morb shrugged again.

109
00:05:26.558 --> 00:05:29.259
"So I put her out of her misery."

110
00:05:30.984 --> 00:05:31.905
Zann gasped.

111
00:05:32.525 --> 00:05:34.526
Was Morb saying that Wyssa was dead?

112
00:05:35.507 --> 00:05:37.388
Morb crooked a finger toward Gliss.

113
00:05:37.968 --> 00:05:41.350
She jerked toward him, like a rag doll being pulled by a string.

114
00:05:44.231 --> 00:05:46.532
Morb dragged her up the side of the plateau.

115
00:05:46.552 --> 00:05:50.655
"Stay there," he ordered Zann and the others.

116
00:05:50.675 --> 00:05:52.796
"I'll be back for you."

117
00:05:55.097 --> 00:06:00.320
When he reached the invisible shield, he snapped his fingers and stepped through the spot where it had

118
00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:04.294
been. Zann guessed that meant he'd disabled the Shield spell.

119
00:06:04.974 --> 00:06:06.415
Morb snapped his fingers again.

120
00:06:07.135 --> 00:06:09.997
Gliss let out a gasp and collapsed to her knees.

121
00:06:10.017 --> 00:06:13.879
"Morb released Gliss from the Immobilization spell."

122
00:06:14.619 --> 00:06:16.421
The color drained from Perda's face.

123
00:06:16.441 --> 00:06:19.682
"Morb is going to feed her to the contraption!"

124
00:06:19.702 --> 00:06:21.503
"Go ahead, girl."

125
00:06:22.244 --> 00:06:23.685
Morb nodded toward Gliss.

126
00:06:23.705 --> 00:06:28.267
"If you have any last words to say to your friends, do it now."
